        "description": "M1 writes the outer dimensions as $(12 + 2x)$ and $(8 + 2x)$.",
        "marks": 1
       },
       {
        "id": "p2",
        "description": "M1 forms $(12 + 2x)(8 + 2x) = 160$ and expands to $96 + 40x + 4x^2$.",
