       }
      ]
     },
     "modelAnswer": "$$\n(12 + 2x)(8 + 2x) = 160\n$$\n\n$$\n96 + 24x + 16x + 4x^2 = 160\n$$\n\n$$\n4x^2 + 40x - 64 = 0 \\Rightarrow x^2 + 10x - 16 = 0\n$$"
    },
    "explanation": "The path adds x on each side, so 2x to each dimension."
   },
